<title>UK: Boc gases plant explosion kills one.</title>
<headline>Boc gases plant explosion kills one.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>British health and industrial gases specialist BOC Group Plc said on Friday that an explosion at its gases plant in Morden, southern England has killed one person and injured another.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement that a fire which followed the explosion, which occurred at 0810 GMT, had been extinguished by the fire brigade.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
